d to uncover the mystery of her sister's disappearance. Explore an expansive village, solve puzzles, unlock memories, and discover monsters where you least expect them.","steam_appid":2802730,"support_info":{"email":"support@mucksgames.com","url":"https://mucksgames.com/"},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America","type":"game","website":"https://mucksgames.com/"}